<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Remote Switches</span></h1>
<hr class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>The Remote switches do not operate Menu bar</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This can be due to the interference between Remote switches:</span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">If you have more than one ModelMaker system and are using the remote switches, you may get interference between them. To avoid this simply change the remote channel used on one system. The channel is changed by adjusting the two rotary switches. One switch is on the MMIB and the other on the remote switches themselves. Both switches must have the same setting. The LED on the MMIB will turn green if the channel is correct or red if one switch is incorrect.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Ensure that there is no obstacle between the remote control and the MMIB antenna.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet">Replace remote control battery.</p>
</li>
</ul>
